      "id": 1000944,
      "name": "[Affinity] Apex Predator",
      "desc": "Nekomata has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Bird Hunter]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\nBird Hunter: When Nekomata hits an enemy from behind, she ignores 16% of her target's <color=#F0D12B>Physical RES</color>. If the enemy is Stunned, all Nekomata's attacks against them are considered back attacks.",
      "desc2": "Nekomata is coiled and ready to pounce, just like an apex predator ready to leap out and disappear at any second.",
